     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Can (pouvoir, savoir)",
     "md": "**Can** + verbe sans to et sans s, à toutes les personnes : I **can** swim. She **can** swim.\n\nNégation : **cannot** (can't) : I **can't** fly.\nQuestion : **Can** you swim ? — Yes, I can. / No, I can't."
