     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "There is / There are",
     "md": "- **There is** + un seul : There **is** a book on the desk.\n- **There are** + plusieurs : There **are** three pupils in the room.\n- Question : **Is there** a ruler ? — **Are there** any pens ?"
